        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "安装和推理请使用配套的 Ming-Image 仓库：",
          "inlines": [
            {
              "text": "安装和推理请使用配套的 "
            },
            {
              "href": "https://github.com/inclusionAI/Ming-Image",
              "text": "Ming-Image 仓库"
            },
            {
              "text": "："
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "code",
          "text": "git clone https://github.com/inclusionAI/Ming-Image\ncd Ming-Image\npip install -r requirements.txt\n"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "自然语言示例（DeepInfra）：",
          "inlines": [
            {
              "text": "自然语言示例（"
            },
            {
              "href": "https://deepinfra.com/blog/ming-design-with-ai",
              "text": "DeepInfra"
            },
            {
              "text": "）："
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "code",
          "text": "python infer.py \\\n  --model inclusionAI/Ming-Image-0.2-Design \\\n  --task text-to-image \\\n  --prompt \"Landing page for a productivity app called Flow. Clean minimal design, white background, generous whitespace. Top navigation with the wordmark 'Flow' on the left and links Product, Pricing, Docs on the right. Centered hero with a bold headline 'Focus without the noise' and a gray subheading 'One calm workspace to plan, focus, and finish.' A single purple call-to-action button labeled 'Start free'. Below the hero, three feature cards with small icons, soft rounded corners and soft shadows. Card 1: title 'Plan your day', body text 'Turn scattered tasks into a clear, realistic plan.' Card 2: title 'Focus sessions', body text 'Start a distraction-free session and stay in flow.' Card 3: title 'See progress', body text 'Know what moved, what slipped, and what comes next.' Modern sans-serif typography. Keep every heading and body line short and legible. Render all text exactly as written. Do not invent additional copy.\" \\\n  --width 2048 --height 2048 \\\n  --output-dir outputs/flow\n"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "为了获得更好的效果，我们推荐使用 Figma 风格的结构化提示词及其 提示词增强器。 四季小屋示例使用的是 结构化提示词文件：",
          "inlines": [
            {
              "text": "为了获得更好的效果，我们推荐使用 Figma 风格的结构化提示词及其 "
            },
            {
              "href": "https://github.com/inclusionAI/Ming-Image#text-to-image-prompt-rewriting",
              "text": "提示词增强器"
            },
            {
              "text": "。 四季小屋示例使用的是 "
            },
            {
              "href": "https://github.com/inclusionAI/Ming-Image/blob/main/assets/t2i_four_seasons_cabin_prompt.json",
              "text": "结构化提示词文件"
            },
            {
              "text": "："
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "code",
          "text": "python infer.py \\\n  --model inclusionAI/Ming-Image-0.2-Design \\\n  --task text-to-image \\\n  --prompt assets/t2i_four_seasons_cabin_prompt.json \\\n  --width 2048 --height 2048 \\\n  --output-dir outputs/t2i\n"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "提示词增强（PE）可以使用 Ling-3.0-flash-VL 或 qwen3.8-27B；参见 文生图提示词改写。",
