        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "This release upgrades and open-sources Ming-Image-0.2-Design. The new version improves complex composition, lighting, and text rendering, and can be used to create e-commerce hero images, UI design drafts, and spatial renderings. The previous-generation layer decomposition model, Ming-Image-0.1-Design-Layer, already separates design images into transparent layers. This upgrade further refines decomposition down to character parts, providing assets for downstream editing and animation. For web design, Ming-Image-0.2-Design works with Ling-3.2-flash to turn design concepts into interactive pages.",
          "inlines": [
            {
              "text": "This release upgrades and open-sources Ming-Image-0.2-Design. The new version improves complex composition, lighting, and text rendering, and can be used to create e-commerce hero images, UI design drafts, and spatial renderings. The previous-generation layer decomposition model, Ming-Image-0.1-Design-Layer, already separates design images into transparent layers. This upgrade further refines decomposition down to character parts, providing assets for downstream editing and animation. For web design, Ming-Image-0.2-Design works with Ling-3.2-flash to turn design concepts into interactive pages."
            }
          ]
        },
